      "content": "\n                    ```document /shared/codx-junior/client/src/components/ai_settings/AIModelSettings.vue\n                    <script setup>\nimport Chat from '../chat/Chat.vue';\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  @codx-ok, please-wait...: Strip this components and keep only the settings edition modal. Remove all variables and methods not related. Component will receive the model object on as a property.\n  <div class=\"w-full h-full flex flex-col gap-2 p-4\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">AI Models</h1>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n      <div\n        v-for=\"model in aiModels\"\n        :key=\"model.name\"\n        class=\"click card border border-slate-300 bg-slate-800 text-white/80 p-4 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between\"\n        @click=\"editModel(model)\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n          <h2 class=\"font-bold text-lg text-primary flex justify-between\">\n            <div>\n              <span>{{ model.name }}</span><span class=\"text-secondary\" v-if=\"model.ai_model && model.name != model.ai_model\"> / {{ model.ai_model }}</span>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-xs btn-circle btn-outline\" @click.stop=\"testModel(model)\" v-if=\"model.model_type === 'llm'\">\n              <i class=\"fa-solid fa-comments\"></i>\n            </button>\n          </h2>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-xs badge-warning\" v-if=\"model.model_type === 'llm'\">\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-brain\"></i> LLM\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-xs badge-info\" v-else>\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-file\"></i> Embeddings\n          </span>\n          <table class=\"w-full\">\n            <tr>\n              <td>Provider:</td>\n              <td>{{ model.ai_provider }}</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr v-if=\"model.model_type === 'llm'\">\n              <td>Temperature:</td>\n              <td>{{ model.settings.temperature }}</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr v-if=\"model.model_type === 'llm'\">\n              <td>Context:</td>\n              <td>\n                <span v-if=\"model.settings.context_length\">\n                  {{ (model.settings.context_length || 0) / 1024 }}K\n                </span>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr v-if=\"model.model_type === 'llm' && model.settings.merge_messages\">\n              <td>Merge messages:</td>\n              <td>{{ model.settings.merge_messages || '-' }}</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr v-if=\"model.model_type === 'embeddings'\">\n              <td>Vector Size:</td>\n              <td>{{ model.settings.vector_size || '-' }}</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr v-if=\"model.model_type === 'embeddings'\">\n              <td>Chunk Size:</td>\n              <td>{{ model.settings.chunk_size || '-' }}</td>\n            </tr>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-2 mt-4\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-xs btn-circle btn-outline text-info\" @click.stop=\"\">\n            <a :href=\"model.url\" target=\"_blank\" v-if=\"model.url\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-info\"></i></a>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-xs btn-circle btn-outline\" @click.stop=\"editModel(model)\">\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-pen-to-square\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-xs btn-circle btn-outline text-error\" @click.stop=\"confirmDelete(model)\">\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-trash-can\"></i>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card border-2 border-dashed border-base-300 p-4 flex justify-center items-center cursor-pointer\" @click=\"editModel(null)\">\n        <span class=\"text-gray-500\">Add New Model</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <modal v-if=\"showDialog\">\n      <form class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" @submit.prevent=\"saveModel\">\n        <div class=\"form-control\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Model Type</span>\n          <select class=\"select select-bordered\" v-model=\"currentModel.model_type\">\n            <option value=\"llm\">LLM</option>\n            <option value=\"embeddings\">Embeddings</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-control\">\n          <span class=\"label\">AI Provider</span>\n          <select class=\"select select-bordered\" v-model=\"currentModel.ai_provider\">\n            <option v-for=\"provider in aiProviders\" :key=\"provider.name\" :value=\"provider.name\">\n              {{ provider.name }}\n            </option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n        <div class=\"form-control\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Model Name</span>\n          <input\n            class=\"input input-bordered\"\n            v-model=\"currentModel.name\"\n            placeholder=\"Model Name\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-control\">\n          <span class=\"label\">AI Provider Model's Name</span>\n          <input\n            class=\"input input-bordered\"\n            v-model=\"currentModel.ai_model\"\n            :placeholder=\"currentModel.name\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-control\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Model url</span>\n          <input\n            class=\"input input-bordered\"\n            v-model=\"currentModel.url\"\n            placeholder=\"Url\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-control\" v-if=\"currentModelIsLLM\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Merge messages</span>\n          <input\n            type=\"checkbox\"\n            class=\"toggle\"\n            v-model.number=\"currentModel.settings.merge_messages\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-control\" v-if=\"currentModelIsLLM\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Temperature</span>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"input input-bordered\"\n            v-model.number=\"currentModel.settings.temperature\"\n            placeholder=\"Temperature\"\n            step=\"0.1\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-control\" v-if=\"!currentModelIsLLM\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Vector Size</span>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"input input-bordered\"\n            v-model.number=\"currentModel.settings.vector_size\"\n            placeholder=\"Vector Size\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-control\" v-if=\"!currentModelIsLLM\">\n          <span class=\"label\">Chunk Size</span>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"input input-bordered\"\n            v-model.number=\"currentModel.settings.chunk_size\"\n            placeholder=\"Chunk Size\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex gap-2 justify-end\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Save</button>\n          <button class=\"btn\" @click=\"showDialog = false\">Cancel</button>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </modal>\n\n    <modal v-if=\"showDeleteDialog\">\n      <div>\n        <p>Are you sure you want to delete {{ modelToDelete.name }}?</p>\n        <div class=\"modal-action\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-error\" @click=\"deleteModel\">\n            Confirm\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"btn\" @click=\"showDeleteDialog = false\">Cancel</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </modal>\n    <modal :close=\"true\" @close=\"closeTestModel\" v-if=\"testModelChat\">\n      <div class=\"text-xl\">\n        Test model <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">{{ testModelChat.model }}</span>\n      </div>\n      <Chat class=\"h-96\" :chat=\"testModelChat\" />\n    </modal>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  props: ['settings'],\n  data() {\n    return {\n      showDialog: false,\n      showDeleteDialog: false,\n      currentModel: {\n        name: '',\n        ai_provider: '',\n        model_type: 'llm',\n        settings: {\n          temperature: 1,\n          vector_size: 1536,\n          chunk_size: 8190\n        }\n      },\n      modelToDelete: null,\n      testModelChat: null\n    }\n  },\n  computed: {\n    aiModels() {\n      return this.settings.ai_models\n    },\n    aiProviders() {\n      return this.settings.ai_providers\n    },\n    currentModelIsLLM() {\n      return this.currentModel?.model_type === 'llm'\n    }\n  },\n  methods: {\n    editModel(model) {\n      if (!model) {\n        model = { settings: {} }\n        this.aiModels.push(model)\n      }\n      this.currentModel = model\n      this.showDialog = true\n    },\n    saveModel() {\n      this.showDialog = false\n      // Add logic to save model\n    },\n    confirmDelete(model) {\n      this.modelToDelete = model\n      this.showDeleteDialog = true\n    },\n    deleteModel() {\n      const index = this.aiModels.findIndex(m => m.name === this.modelToDelete.name)\n      if (index !== -1) {\n        this.aiModels.splice(index, 1)\n      }\n      this.showDeleteDialog = false\n    },\n    async testModel(model) {\n      this.testModelChat = await this.$projects.createNewChat({ \n        temp: true,\n        model: model.name\n      })\n    },\n    closeTestModel() {\n      this.$projects.deleteChat(this.testModelChat)\n      this.testModelChat = null\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n                    ```\n\n                    Apply these changes to /shared/codx-junior/client/src/components/ai_settings/AIModelSettings.vue:\n                    User commented in line 5: Strip this components and keep only the settings edition modal. Remove all variables and methods not related. Component will receive the model object on as a property.\n                    \n                    Instructions:\n                      Best practices for this file:\n            Project uses DaisyUI for components, use them instead basic HTML elements\nAll components must have same structure: \"setup\", \"template\", \"script\".\nVue Component Example:\n```vue file/path/to/Component.vue\n<script setup>\nimport Component from './component.vue'\nimport markdown from 'mardown'\n</script>\n<template>\n<div class=\"w.full h-full flex gap-2\">\n</div>\n</template>\n<script>\nexport default {\nprops: [].\ndata (){\n// Reactive data, don't use \"ref\"\n return { myVariable: null }\n},\ncomputed: {},\nwatch: {},\nmethods: {}\n}\n</sctipt>\n```\nImportant:\n* No css, use TailwindCSS clases\n* No need to import ref, computed or mapState \n* export default component object\n* Use component \"data\" method to return an object variables\n* Use component \"computed\" to define computed properties\n\" Use component \"methods\" to define component methods \n* Use \"this.$storex\" or \"$storex\" to access store data.\n* To access vue store data use \"$storex\"\n* \"script setup\" section contains ONLY imports, no variables, properties bnor methods\n* Vue component definition will be exporting a default object like, without ref, nor computed imports\n* Don't use \";\" in the javascript or typescript code\n* Avoid long functions\n* Add short and concise comments for complex functions\nMake sure all vue components follow this structure:\n```vue\n<script setup><!-- Import all components and libraries on the top -->\n</script>\n<template><!-- Component markup -->\n<div></div>\n</template>\n<script><!-- Component logic -->\nexport default {\n}\n</script>\n```\n\nUse fontawesome for icons like: <i class=\"fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket\"></i>\n            \n                      Apply all comments to the document and return a final version.\n                      Pay attention to do not loose any detail or part of the document.\n                      Return only the file content \n                    ",
